    "updated_at": "2025-12-05T13:20:37Z",
    "body": "Also, wouldn't it be better if we end up throwing for the cases where there is no true backing origin? When `MessageEvent`'s `origin` is created from a string or when `initMessageEvent()` is called it seems that `Origin.from()` shouldn't work.",
